# Read by gh ship's local CI-fallback gate (agent-tools ci/ship/ship.sh) when GitHub
# Actions is billing-blocked / structurally down. Points the fallback at this repo's
# own ci/local-checks.sh, which mirrors ci.yml's real jobs (typecheck, lint, tests,
# extension production build) plus the leftover-grep / secret-scan / dependency-audit
# gates — instead of silently falling back to a bare `npm test` (tests only, no
# typecheck/lint/ext-build coverage). See ci/local-checks.sh header for details.
#
# Only SHIP_LOCAL_TEST_DIR / SHIP_LOCAL_TEST_CMD are recognized; committed content at
# HEAD is trusted the same as rig.yaml/package.json (see ship.sh's _ship_config_load).
SHIP_LOCAL_TEST_CMD=ci/local-checks.sh
